msgid "Launches Minecraft via gamemoderun so that Feral Interactive's\n"
"GameMode daemon can apply CPU governor and scheduler optimisations\n"
"for the duration of the game session.\n"
"Requires GameMode to be installed (package: gamemode)."
msgstr "Lanceert Minecraft via gamemoderun zodat Feral Interactive's\n"
"GameMode daemon CPU governor en planner optimalisaties\n"
"kan toepassen voor de duur van de spel sessie.\n"
"vereist dat GameMode wordt geïnstalleerd (package: gamemode)."

